<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TIGER CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of matches played in</p>
<p>the Tiger Cup soccer tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>Laos 1 Vietnam 1 (halftime 0-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Laos - Luang Amath Chalana (52nd minute)</p>
<p>Vietnam - Le Huynh Duc (85th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,400</p>
<p>Myanmar 5 Cambodia 0 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Tin Myo Hung (14th), Win Aung (35th and 54th), Myo</p>
<p>Hlaing Win (71st), Maung Maung Oo (90th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,500</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, points</p>
<p>(top two teams from each group qualify for semifinals):</p>
<p> Vietnam	  2  1  1  0  4</p>
<p> Myanmar	  1  1  0  0  3</p>
<p> Indonesia	1  1  0  0  3</p>
<p> Laos	     2  0  1  1  1</p>
<p> Cambodia	 2  0  0  2  0</p>
